                <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
                   <p>
   <lb n="1"/><g ref="sym:doubleBar-ornate" type="punctuation">.</g> kaṁluṅ silā neḥ
   <lb n="2"/>nāmakaraṇa mra-
   <lb n="3"/>tañ śri rājapativa-
   <lb n="4"/>rmma vraḥ kamrateṅ
   <lb n="5"/>Añ śri rājapatīva-
   <lb n="6"/>rmma kaṁsteṅ śri rāja-
   <lb n="7"/>pativarmma gi vraḥ pā-
   <lb n="8"/>da kamrateṅ A-
   <lb n="9"/>ñ śri jayavarmma-
   <lb n="10"/>deva pre cār ta
   <lb n="11"/>suvarṇṇapātra
   <lb n="12"/>gi pi Oy cval
   <lb n="13"/>jā nai kamrate-
   <lb n="14"/>ṅ jagat C(alena)
</p>
                   
</div>
